/v/t64.5771-25/38974504_999332164037048_8352848161181583365_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uEZpB7gFb_MQ7kNvwHUZkqR&_nc_oc=Adpgp49SBaU_YX4U_iluqR7N9NyVzhIjV66R64Kxq_-qN5bsv71vhafDTgP00iYBegA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7HgELtXad4K2OXtpKs6M7YP-fpTltNWm6YDtmCeMx23g&oe=6A106F79"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom2.png", "id": "1060903411489141", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031501_1060903414822474_9192607785681237416_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bLeT9TTgfZ8Q7kNvwEW73kJ&_nc_oc=AdpGv9bIYYYWSufshgOGg77e8GeUKxpF155AtNBag5-_0rcTlx-5pL3FSSFDQVdh-Ow&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6X9L9OlZWCXD8R-gVW8_qx_G0D_fhR18zjdZGeCZz5Hw&oe=6A108103"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom3.png", "id": "1333559243720099", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_1333559247053432_5526570972152141129_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fcjNb1aGBVgQ7kNvwEdOjYZ&_nc_oc=Ado6faQXPV5AIyUjhFmllf8lMVcrqwCzPQmtmpm2g4hMuDLDNPvcJ35Cmb9zt1ZqC64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4iCQTy5bMECFQ2WpO4gTMD2zZQuitbg3ntVQ1a7hz0Xg&oe=6A1077CE"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom4.png", "id": "403819987828479", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_403819991161812_8720327022213224385_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xbg8GlNPoK0Q7kNvwFJ3hYQ&_nc_oc=AdqaJpgM9wSo_jwuxavE7S1L3ks_9QzH3vuIpJYTyvZkysqqBdXdVDaGEUekq0Luw6w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af78LF8715G4xhdNlQSEP99FikuD181kxJSwWr6RKjDNNQ&oe=6A107FF3"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom5.png", "id": "397854095192936", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_397854098526269_4581865977018394136_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cxoyE2Mo0sgQ7kNvwGrjM0w&_nc_oc=Adpn2tnk5Oo1IE-n1w5mJTi4vhawE0uL2OKMDkToPcZi0lv3C-TCryBC9xa2VT_BNEQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4eedfPkZr44fdMJFA8K9VuB1W5Y0gADIkQB7SunExrFQ&oe=6A10793B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR-ME: Fire In The Engine Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the script of the scenario \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb after some welding work in the engine room, a fire starts in the bilge of the engine room, also spreading to the main electrical panel.The \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app includes actions mentioned below that are urgent at the situation of fire:\n\n-Go to the meeting point. Recount\n\n-Grab, carry and put on \ufb01re \ufb01ghter equipment, prove function     and adjustment\n\n-Grab one \ufb01re extinguisher and put it ready for use.\n\n-Going to the engine control room and trying to su\ufb00ocate the \ufb01re, with a \ufb01re  extinguisher.                          \n\nThe development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project.", "short_description": "\u00abVR-ME: Fire in the Engine Room\u00bb app is about an emergency situation when you\u2019re working onboard a vessel that is out to sea, an engine fire is one of the last things you want to deal with.Engine room fires also obviously put a ship filled with maritime workers at risk of injury or death. The development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project."}]}, "developer_name": "SQLearn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sqlearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "The consortium of the VR-ME project", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr-me.eu/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating":